MODULE: ReplayReadsRetiredWal
TARGET: ReplayAboveCursor
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: leaf re-replay reads the logical tree name's WAL, which after an alias swap is the retired physical tree's log, not the log of the physical tree the walk resolved
PERTURBS: ReReplay
BOUNDS: MaxSwap = 1

--- FIND
    /\ Selection # {}
    /\ inflight' = inflight \cup {RepairMsg(r.k, r.ts, r.del) : r \in Selection}
    /\ consumed' = consumed + Cardinality(Selection)
--- REPLACE
    /\ {r \in retired : r.k \in loc /\ r.ts > hwm} # {}
    /\ inflight' = inflight \cup {RepairMsg(r.k, r.ts, r.del) : r \in {x \in retired : x.k \in loc /\ x.ts > hwm}}
    /\ consumed' = consumed + Cardinality({r \in retired : r.k \in loc /\ r.ts > hwm})
--- END
